{"id":"Wd7c810b42e6f52411f62e0a6","zh":"约束模态矩阵","en":"","name":"约束模态矩阵","language":"zh","domain":"铁路动力学、信号与建模方法","concept_id":"C885c6b560ff31f3437e3","families":[],"definition_zh":"动态子结构降阶中与界面约束变形相关的模态矩阵。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":"与主模态矩阵共同用于坐标变换及子结构组装；两者是不同的矩阵。","usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wd7c810b42e6f52411f62e0a6","text":"约束模态矩阵","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S5aea795d19002b28edc9","source_id":"P133","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"究方法动态子结构法(CMS法)主要通过将复杂结构划分为若干子结构,基于主模态截断法提取其主模态矩阵与约束模态矩阵;利用坐标变换矩阵,根据子结构间的界面位移协调条件将各子结构降阶矩阵合并,进而得到系统广义坐标下的运动方程, 之后将方程组求解得到的模态坐标解变换为物理坐标解,即可求解复杂结构完整的低频振动特性。","citations":[{"source_id":"P133","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"sources":{"P133":{"id":"P133","title":"地铁上盖建筑车致环境振动预测模型及影响因素研究","authors":"张小安,王庞瑞,李姝婷,杨建近,徐磊,张晓芸","year":"2025","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20250090","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"张小安等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-study-on-the-prediction-of-building-vibration-induced-by-subway-operation-and-influencing-factors"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W47b3fcd26b836377816c2b15","name":"constraint-mode matrix","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W47b3fcd26b836377816c2b15","name":"constraint-mode matrix","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W47b3fcd26b836377816c2b15","name":"constraint-mode matrix","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P133","title":"地铁上盖建筑车致环境振动预测模型及影响因素研究","authors":"张小安,王庞瑞,李姝婷,杨建近,徐磊,张晓芸","year":"2025","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20250090","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"张小安等（2025）","ov